# Multi-agent boundaries

Agents must stay within their owned folders and features.

If another owned area needs a change:
- minimize edits
- prefer creating stubs/interfaces
- clearly call it out in the completion report

Avoid:
- large refactors across unrelated features
- renaming shared abstractions without need
- changing UI and persistence in the same task unless explicitly requested